      "description": "* Add setlist feature\n\n- Allows user to select multiple songs to a set, which are then played in sequence before returning to the library menu.\n\n* Allow users to create and curate custom playlists.\n\n* Refinements to playlists and setlist UX\n\n- Ad hoc setlists are now launched with hold+release on yellow\n- All playlists (including favorites) are now found in the playlist library menu\n- Entire playlist can now be added to setlist in one go\n\n* Playlist and setlist improvements\n- Add ability to save current setlist to a playlist\n- Show current setlist in playlist view, allowing deletion of songs or entire setlist\n- Fix bug where exiting playlist select view returned to main menu instead of library\n- Add ability to add playlist to setlist in one go\n\n* Add setlist specific pause menu with skip option.\n\n* address review comments\n\n- Make setlist pause inactive by default\n- Move skip option in setlist pause menu to second to last position\n- Don't allow user to create a playlist named the same as the localized \"Current Setlist\" string.\n- Make rename dialog text field active when dialog is created\n\n* initial implementation of an actual \"play a show\" feature. really, this time.\n\nCurrently outstanding issues:\n- Needs localization of category names\n- There's a known bug when exiting the show list view that can sometimes result in the library view becoming empty until a new show is started and exited in a different way (or played to completion)\n- \"A Random Song\" appears too often since it is the fallback for a couple of other categories.\n\n* Improve category selection for play a show\n\n* Support show category name localization\n\n* Fix navigation bug on exiting show mode\n- Also clean up ultimately unused stuff and add translation for yellow button in show mode\n\n* Play a show improvements\n\n- Add selection timeout setting. Defaults to 10 seconds but can be adjusted up to 30 seconds to give more time for voting.\n- Add display to the show picker dialog to show which/how many players have already voted.\n\n* Briefly highlight the category that won the vote before refreshing the list.\n\n* Add setting to require EMHX for songs to appear in play a show\n\n* Add play a show header to settings on songs tab\n\n* Play a show is now activated with blue\n\n* fix up issues caused by rebase"
